          <msContents>
            <summary>Collection of 395 numbered, and twelve unnumbered cookery receipts in Italian.
                Fol. 1 Tabvla De La Prese/Nte Oper/A. 13 (red) Ad fare uno sciugo a una cossa de / castrato o vero spalla. c. 1º. 146 (End of numbered receipts) ... et/unge cum uno poco de zafferame / e olio: e poi lassala cocere. // 
              Finis. 150 (End of 'A fare una substantia a uno infirmo') ... Et poi metterli / tucti queste cose in uno pignatello et / fa bollire a foco lento. 
              </summary>
            <textLang mainLang="it" source="IANA">Italian</textLang>
            <msItem n="1" xml:id="MS_211_1">
              <author></author>
              <title type="original">Cookery-Books, Italian: Before 1500</title>
              <textLang mainLang="it" source="IANA">Italian</textLang>
              <filiation></filiation>
            </msItem>
          </msContents>
