            <handDesc>
              <handNote script="humanistic">Written in a neat humanistic hand.</handNote>
            </handDesc>
            <decoDesc>
              <decoNote type="marginal">Grotesque marginal decoration on ll. 13, 52, 96v, 127, 133v, 146.</decoNote>
              <decoNote type="rubrication">Ornamental initials in red, other initials also in red, a few black. Headings in red.</decoNote>
            </decoDesc>
            <additions>
              A name has been struck through in the upper margin of the first leaf; in the lower margin 'Joannes Christophorus Ciccurini', in a 16th cent. hand.
            </additions>
            <bindingDesc>
              <binding>
                <p>Original half calf binding over wooden boards, metal and leather clasps repaired.</p>
